  "ruleText": "Mid 406.05 Teaching Midwifery. Documentation of midwifery teaching shall include:\n\n(a) The name of the course(s) taught; and\n\n(b) A letter of confirmation signed by an official of the institution sponsoring the courses.\n\nSource. #8840, eff 3-13-07, EXPIRED: 3-13-15\n\nNew. #11095, INTERIM, eff 5-12-16, EXPIRED: 11-8-16\n\nNew. #12040, eff 11-10-16",
